        {
          "text": "Jatel ma kisi peco kodi acel kwoŋ omin go mathin jobolo kwir ma tic pajo, paka wade pajo, jocway ri Were i wi migam nyikway Aron oyido jotimo. Kere Daudi, Zadok, Ahimelek, kodi ma nonin pa jocway ri Were i wi migam kodi apa Jolevi jobedo jokony.",
